 "<b style=\"color:#1f4e9c\"><i lang=\"pt\" translate=\"no\">Muito prazer!</i></b> &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#5a6680\">¡Mucho gusto!</span>": "<b style=\"color:#1f4e9c\"><i lang=\"pt\" translate=\"no\">Muito prazer!</i></b> &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#5a6680\">Encantat!</span>",
